# 1.3 Separable Differential Equations and Modeling

## Overview

This section introduces separable differential equations and their applications in mathematical modeling. It focuses on solving first-order differential equations using the method of separation of variables.

## Learning Objectives

- Understand the concept of separable differential equations.
- Apply the method of separation of variables.
- Solve initial value problems.
- Model real-world problems using differential equations.

## Topics

- Separation of Variables
- Initial Value Problems
- Mathematical Modeling

